        "category": "evieve",
        "digest": "Reimplementation of MSP <o>curve~</o> in gen abstraction form",
        "description": "evi_curve is almost identical to MSP <o>curve~</o> (without list processing of course) providing exact ramp destination time and curve parameter. In gen~ this is expensive and therefore not so useful. Based on Graham Wakefield's original example (which is no longer present in the gen~ examples folder)."
